#MicroXplorer Configuration settings - do not modify
# ============================================================================
# ENR312 ROTARY INVERTED PENDULUM -- TARGET CONFIGURATION
#
# THIS IS NOT THE VEHICLE IOC.
# The vehicle IOC is <repo root>/vehicle.ioc and must never be
# edited to serve the pendulum. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
#
# STATUS OF THIS FILE: the pendulum's single pin/peripheral configuration.
# The lab firmware is built by this directory's Makefile from hand-written
# init in src/enr312_board.c, which mirrors every setting below
# (make ioc-check). CubeMX VALIDATED 2026-10-09: CubeMX 6.13.0 (bundled with
# STM32CubeIDE 1.17.0) loads this file headless, and its generated init
# compiles; output and regeneration script in firmware/enr312/cubemx/.
# Never generate into this directory: it would overwrite the hand-written target.
#
# Pin map authority: <UCLA Edukit project>/ -- see inc/enr312_board.h
# for per-pin file:line citations.
# ============================================================================
